## Performance

Avoid expensive operations in the component body. Use `useMemo` in Client Components:

```tsx
// Client Component
"use client";
import { useMemo } from "react";

export function CalendarPreview({ posts }: { posts: ScheduledPost[] }) {
  const days = useMemo(() => {
    // expensive computation: filtering, date parsing, grouping
    return computeDays(posts);
  }, [posts]);

  return <div>{days.map(...)}</div>;
}
```

In Server Components, compute before the JSX return:

```tsx
// Server Component
export default async function Page() {
  const data = await computeExpensiveData(); // runs once on server
  return <Display data={data} />;
}
```

