## Common Mistakes

| Mistake | Problem | Fix |
|---------|---------|-----|
| `"use client"` missing from file using `useState` | Runtime error | Add `"use client"` at top |
| `next-themes` import in Server Component | Browser-only API crashes | Move to Client Component |
| `usePathname` in Server Component | Hook not available in RSC | Move to Client Component |
| Module-level JSX with React state | Evaluated at module scope | Move JSX inside function body |
| Client Component wrapping server-only data fetch | Defeats Server Components | Fetch in Server, pass as props |
| Third-party context provider in Server Component | useContext null error | Wrap in Client Component |
| Importing from `radix-ui` instead of `@radix-ui/react-*` | Types-only package | Use actual packages |
| `as any` casting | Loses type safety | Define proper types |
| `Record<string, unknown>` for known shapes | Type errors on access | Define interface |

