## Verification

Before committing:

- [ ] Files with hooks have `"use client"` at the top
- [ ] Server Components don't import client-only packages
- [ ] No JSX expressions at module scope (outside component functions)
- [ ] No `<Icon />` JSX inside const objects at module level
- [ ] Icon references stored as component types, not rendered elements
- [ ] Configuration objects use plain data, not JSX
- [ ] No `as any` casts (use proper types)
- [ ] `pnpm run typecheck` passes (0 errors)
- [ ] `pnpm run build` passes (no hydration errors)
